\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. \cf0  Oh, helper stretch your help to me
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 Be merciful to me, just Lord.
\par Your beloved son I've been
\par In this world full of evil and troubles.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. I lift my eyes unto You, Lord,
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 You, I regard as all I have;
\par You, Saviour Jesus Christ,
\par You are the true redeemer that I have.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3.  Therefore, I feel a peace within'
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 I wait for you expectantly;
\par Your name is my foundation,
\par I declare: Amen! So shall it be.
\par \pard\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2\fs14 
\par }

